    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062060/extras/fb4295eb2d58a4ce814b2a4942ae830d.avif?t=1755528883\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p></p><br><h1>WISHLIST &amp; FOLLOW \u2728</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062060/extras/35ee0ce0e280139f247c8c92ef2e9113.avif?t=1755528883\" width=1232 height=400 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive Thru is a first-person perspective simulation game where players interact directly with customers to take their orders, prepare food and beverages in the kitchen, and handle payments. Your goal is to attract more customers and improve your restaurant's efficiency by making strategic decisions to enhance customer satisfaction and grow your business. <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062060/extras/412e1297fba0e44aa9534758b1ed6d40.poster.avif?t=1755528883\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062060/extras/412e1297fba0e44aa9534758b1ed6d40.webm?t=1755528883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062060/extras/412e1297fba0e44aa9534758b1ed6d40.mp4?t=1755528883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf5f<strong> Main Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time for Online Shopping!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order everything you need to keep your restaurant running smoothly! Fresh ingredients, essential supplies, and kitchen upgrades\u2014all delivered right to your doorstep. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062060/extras/5ec009d540dc8a90c110d7e472cc929e.poster.avif?t=1755528883\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062060/extras/5ec009d540dc8a90c110d7e472cc929e.webm?t=1755528883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062060/extras/5ec009d540dc8a90c110d7e472cc929e.mp4?t=1755528883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fast Delivery, Fresh Ingredients!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay stocked with high quality produce, meats, and essentials. A well-managed inventory means happy customers and faster service!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062060/extras/d1a9331b9951bc39e28f0f52b103c278.poster.avif?t=1755528883\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062060/extras/d1a9331b9951bc39e28f0f52b103c278.webm?t=1755528883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062060/extras/d1a9331b9951bc39e28f0f52b103c278.mp4?t=1755528883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Restock &amp; Organize!\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your storage efficiently by arranging ingredients properly. Keep your kitchen fully stocked to avoid running out of key items during rush hours!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062060/extras/d49c6e20b225b4162d5f78c3ec2a3bd8.poster.avif?t=1755528883\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062060/extras/d49c6e20b225b4162d5f78c3ec2a3bd8.webm?t=1755528883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062060/extras/d49c6e20b225b4162d5f78c3ec2a3bd8.mp4?t=1755528883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Place It Anywhere!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your restaurant layout! Position cooking stations, prep areas, and storage exactly how you want for the most efficient workflow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062060/extras/8e23387cd8e700174a15ac29e0337da9.poster.avif?t=1755528883\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062060/extras/8e23387cd8e700174a15ac29e0337da9.webm?t=1755528883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062060/extras/8e23387cd8e700174a15ac29e0337da9.mp4?t=1755528883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the Grill!</strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grill juicy burgers, fry crispy fries, and cook up delicious meals with precision. Perfect your cooking techniques to serve the best fast food in town! <br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062060/extras/1c6035fec18d66609852833e94695749.poster.avif?t=1755528883\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062060/extras/1c6035fec18d66609852833e94695749.webm?t=1755528883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062060/extras/1c6035fec18d66609852833e94695749.mp4?t=1755528883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time to Clean!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain a spotless kitchen and dining area to ensure top hygiene ratings. A clean restaurant means better reviews and more satisfied customers! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062060/extras/63df13e452218eea021f429112e63e96.poster.avif?t=1755528883\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062060/extras/63df13e452218eea021f429112e63e96.webm?t=1755528883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062060/extras/63df13e452218eea021f429112e63e96.mp4?t=1755528883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Add to Your Whishlist:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To support us during the development process, please add our game to your wishlist and join our Discord!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive Thru is a first-person perspective simulation game where players interact directly with customers to take their orders, prepare food and beverages in the kitchen, and handle payments. Your goal is to attract more customers and improve your restaurant's efficiency by making strategic decisions to enhance customer satisfaction and grow your business. <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062060/extras/412e1297fba0e44aa9534758b1ed6d40.poster.avif?t=1755528883\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062060/extras/412e1297fba0e44aa9534758b1ed6d40.webm?t=1755528883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062060/extras/412e1297fba0e44aa9534758b1ed6d40.mp4?t=1755528883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf5f<strong> Main Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time for Online Shopping!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order everything you need to keep your restaurant running smoothly! Fresh ingredients, essential supplies, and kitchen upgrades\u2014all delivered right to your doorstep. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062060/extras/5ec009d540dc8a90c110d7e472cc929e.poster.avif?t=1755528883\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062060/extras/5ec009d540dc8a90c110d7e472cc929e.webm?t=1755528883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062060/extras/5ec009d540dc8a90c110d7e472c