ideo class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062060/extras/63df13e452218eea021f429112e63e96.poster.avif?t=1755528883\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062060/extras/63df13e452218eea021f429112e63e96.webm?t=1755528883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062060/extras/63df13e452218eea021f429112e63e96.mp4?t=1755528883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Add to Your Whishlist:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To support us during the development process, please add our game to your wishlist and join our Discord!</p>",
